#: source/installation/uninstall.md:179
msgid "**Note**"
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/uninstall.md:181
msgid ""
"After you complete the steps here, you will still have an empty `/nix` "
"directory. This is an expected sign of a successful uninstall. The empty `/"
"nix` directory will disappear the next time you reboot."
msgstr ""

#: source/installation/uninstall.md:185
msgid ""
"You do not have to reboot to finish uninstalling Nix. The uninstall is "
"complete. macOS (Catalina+) directly controls root directories, and its read-"
"only root will prevent you from manually deleting the empty `/nix` "
"mountpoint."
msgstr ""

